# AlphaSense account API (:8010).
# Single worker is REQUIRED: the login/register rate limiter is per-process
# memory (see src/auth/app.py). Multiple workers would each enforce an
# independent budget. For more throughput, put a shared edge limiter in front.
# Health: GET http://127.0.0.1:8010/api/auth/health -> 200 (503 on DB failure).
[Unit]
Description=AlphaSense account API
After=network-online.target mysql.service
Wants=network-online.target
Requires=mysql.service

[Service]
Type=simple
User=alphasense
WorkingDirectory=/opt/alphasense
EnvironmentFile=/opt/alphasense/.env
ExecStart=/opt/alphasense/.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn src.auth.app:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8010 --workers 1
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
